// // -- Subject broadcast (%) ----------------------------------------
// // Dispatches on any PushStream-namespace instance. Slot shape
// // disambiguates subject vs. stream: subjects carry `associated`,
// // streams carry `subscribers`. Broadcast on a bare stream is
// // ill-formed (spec §6.10.1: "Unary subj% is ill-formed" applies
