// // -- ~<* (consumption) --------------------------------------------
// // Two-phase per Channel~<* pattern:
// //   1. Discovery scope — run comp, catch first Bind, extract source
// //      stream from #.value via Done@ arm-terminal.
// //   2. Per-emission — subscribe an observer to (source ⋂ signalSt)
// //      via takeUntil@; each emission opens a fresh Effect.Host.Do
// //      scope over comp and runs ret on the payload. Terminal
// //      Left@ payload in the block body dispatches Map-arm →
// //      broadcast the signal subject (unsubscribes this observer
// //      via takeUntil close-cascade) and resolves result with the
// //      Left payload. Source close resolves result with
// //      Left@ "PushStream Closed".

